  "notation_note": "The cis-1,4 unit is shown -- chemically the same repeat unit as natural rubber, but manufactured. cis-content varies by catalyst (90-92% via anionic Li-initiation vs. ~98.5% via Ziegler-Natta), which is why the synthetic route is treated as its own entry.",
